  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 relative z-10">
    
    <header class="space-y-6">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-500/30 bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide">
          📍 Estancia de Investigación en Canadá
        </div>
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-500/30 bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-300 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide">
          🎙️ Consultoría y Conferencias (Disponible)
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
        Hola, soy <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500">Luis Arenas</span>
      </h1>
      
      <div class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base text-green-400 bg-black/60 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-500/30 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,197,94,0.1)] inline-block">
        <span class="text-slate-400">root@l-arenas:~$</span> ./analyze_profile.sh <br/>
        <span class="text-cyan-400">> Extracting key parameters...</span> <br/>
        <span id="typewriter" class="font-bold text-white"></span><span class="animate-pulse">_</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-400 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mt-4">
        Investigador y desarrollador enfocado en <strong class="text-slate-200">Visión por Computadora</strong>, <strong class="text-slate-200">Inteligencia Artificial</strong> y hardware aplicado. Desarrollo modelos de negocio empresariales e institucionales, haciéndolos más eficientes y enfocados a su visión y misión mediante la integración estratégica de plataformas digitales y algoritmos avanzados.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mt-24 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          Experiencia y Estrategia
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="relative pl-4 border-l border-slate-800 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">2026 - Presente</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 mt-1">Investigador Visitante</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium">University of British Columbia Okanagan</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Estancia internacional en convergencia de IA, sistemas autónomos y control de hardware en tiempo real.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative pl-4 border-l border-slate-800 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">2023 - Presente</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 mt-1">Profesor Universitario & Consultor</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium">Docencia y Asesoría Tecnológica</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Impartición de cátedras sobre Elementos Programables. Adicionalmente, estructuración de estrategias digitales para eficiencia operativa empresarial.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"></path></svg>
          Educación
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="relative pl-4 border-l border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-blue-400">En Curso (Graduación Dic 2027)</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 mt-1">Doctorado en Ciencias en Electrónica</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium">INAOE</p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative pl-4 border-l border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Completado</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 mt-1">Maestría en Ciencias en Electrónica</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium">INAOE</p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative pl-4 border-l border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Completado</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 mt-1">Ingeniería en Mecatrónica</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium">Universidad Iberoamericana Puebla</p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative pl-4 border-l border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Completado</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 mt-1">Ing. en Comunicaciones y Electrónica</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium">Universidad Iberoamericana Puebla</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="proyectos" class="mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-10 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">Desarrollo Tecnológico y Proyectos</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 overflow-hidden hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all flex flex-col md:col-span-2">
          <div class="h-64 w-full bg-slate-800 relative flex justify-center items-center overflow-hidden">
            <span class="absolute z-10 text-slate-500 font-mono text-sm">[ Sube 'satellite.jpg' a public ]</span>
            <img src="/portafolio-luis/satellite.jpg" alt="Satellite Scan" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-20 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500 opacity-0 hover:opacity-100" onload="this.classList.remove('opacity-0'); this.previousElementSibling.style.display='none';" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-cyan-500/20 to-transparent w-full h-full z-30 animate-[scan_3s_ease-in-out_infinite] opacity-50 pointer-events-none"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Escaneo Satelital en Tiempo Real</h3>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 border border-red-500/30">Nivel Gubernamental & Académico</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4 max-w-4xl">Desarrollo de algoritmos de procesamiento de imágenes satelitales en tiempo real. Este modelo de alta complejidad matemática está diseñado para aplicaciones de inteligencia territorial, monitoreo ambiental y seguridad para entidades académicas y de gobierno.</p>
            <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Algoritmos de Escaneo</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Teledetección</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 overflow-hidden hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all flex flex-col">
          <div class="h-48 w-full bg-slate-800 relative flex justify-center items-center">
            <span class="absolute z-10 text-slate-500 font-mono text-sm">[ Sube 'drone.jpg' a public ]</span>
            <img src="/portafolio-luis/drone.jpg" alt="Autonomous Drone" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-20 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500 opacity-0 hover:opacity-100" onload="this.classList.remove('opacity-0'); this.previousElementSibling.style.display='none';" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Sistemas Aéreos y Drones Autónomos</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">Desarrollo de sistemas de navegación autónoma y algoritmos de control aplicados a entornos empresariales y de investigación. Operación aérea respaldada por certificación oficial de Piloto de Drones de Transport Canada.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Autonomía</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Control GCS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 overflow-hidden hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all flex flex-col">
          <div class="h-48 w-full bg-slate-800 relative flex justify-center items-center overflow-hidden">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506521781263-d8422e82f27a?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Smart Parkade" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-20 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Smart Parkade System</h3>
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-400 border border-yellow-500/30">Berkeley 2nd Place</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">Sistema de estacionamiento inteligente reconocido en competencia en Berkeley. Optimiza la logística de espacios utilizando sensores en tiempo real para mejorar la eficiencia del modelo de negocio.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Smart City</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Optimización</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 overflow-hidden hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all flex flex-col">
          <div class="aspect-video w-full bg-black">
            <iframe class="w-full h-full" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/DExxQR5RKNM" title="MARKUS Robot" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">The Robot MARKUS</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">Diseño de robot de servicio orientado a la optimización de atención en negocios.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4 items-center mt-2">
              <a href="https://www.hackster.io/" target="_blank" class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">Ver en Hackster <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 overflow-hidden hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all flex flex-col">
          <div class="h-48 w-full bg-slate-800 relative flex justify-center items-center">
            <span class="absolute z-10 text-slate-500 font-mono text-sm">[ Sube 'saqms.jpg' a public ]</span>
            <img src="/portafolio-luis/saqms.jpg" alt="SAQMS" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-20 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500 opacity-0 hover:opacity-100" onload="this.classList.remove('opacity-0'); this.previousElementSibling.style.display='none';" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">SAQMS & School Warden</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">Evolución de monitoreo ambiental escolar a un sistema empresarial con Firebase y Machine Learning (ARIMA).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4 items-center mt-2">
              <a href="https://www.hackster.io/" target="_blank" class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">Ver Warden en Hackster <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="publicaciones" class="mt-24 mb-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-10 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
        <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-green-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg>
        Publicaciones Científicas
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border-2 border-blue-500/30 bg-blue-900/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/30">IEEE I&M Magazine</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Smart Air Quality Monitoring System - a Student Project</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">L. E. Arenas-Deseano, et al.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11482784" target="_blank" class="shrink-0 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white transition-colors">Ver en IEEE Xplore</a>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">Revista Latinoamericana</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-200">Artículo Publicado en Revista Latinoamericana</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">L. E. Arenas-Deseano</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase rounded bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/30">En Preparación / In Prep</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-200">Context-Aware Emotion Classification</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Investigación en desarrollo sobre modelos de visión por computadora sensibles al contexto.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 border-t border-slate-800 pt-8">Historial Dinámico (Vía ORCID)</h3>
      <div id="orcid-publications" class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-slate-500 animate-pulse">Consultando la base de datos de ORCID...</p>
      </div>
      
